{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1523417-storypath-crossover-using-other-storypath-books-for-antagonists-abilities","id":1523417,"title":"Storypath crossover: Using other storypath books for antagonists/abilities","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-01T08:11:59-07:00","id":1523417,"title":"Storypath crossover: Using other storypath books for antagonists/abilities","content":"Good morning all! <br /> <br /> I have been a Gm for decades at this point but am very new to storypath (came from a weg star wars, call of cthulhu, world of darkness background). I have loved the trinity universe games since the first edition of Aeon (still have my original, plastic-spiral bound original) and am digging into the continuum, but am not versed in the other storypath games yet. Is there any conversion needed ifni wanted to steal things from the other games (mostly antagonists) and drop them into trinity?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2778-tlalchitonatiuh","name":"Tlalchitonatiuh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-01T08:32:52-07:00","id":1523419,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s ok to use Antagonists the way they are.<br /> <br /> If you are using Scion or TCF antagonists I personally suggest to reduce the high dice pools and add enhancements, as TC usually deal with more enhancements than Scion and TCF, but it\u2019s not that important to be honest.<br /> <br /> DRE is ok and works exactly like TC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-01T09:09:40-07:00","id":1523424,"title":"","content":"DRE looks like what i'm looking for. Had an idea for a generational campaign loosely based on the more action-pulp-horror aspects of the resident evil games (i.e. weird plants and parasites with a very long pseudo-science history dating back years, evil corporations out for nothing but profit, and improbably durable heroes fighting them) along with marvel zombies/blackest night, zombie nazis, and a bitnof dead space for the aeon Era. Thanks again!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2778-tlalchitonatiuh","name":"Tlalchitonatiuh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}